</span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><br>Use probes to venture into subspace, search for resources and signals among the stars, and uncover the secrets hidden in deep space.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470160/extras/95caa4671643af2ed8c3f36425fee140.poster.avif?t=1720833286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470160/extras/95caa4671643af2ed8c3f36425fee140.webm?t=1720833286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470160/extras/95caa4671643af2ed8c3f36425fee140.mp4?t=1720833286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
